# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# zOS-OpenCore — ignored paths
#
# TRACKED (source of truth): pyproject.toml, setup.py, MANIFEST.in, uv.lock,
# README.md, .gitignore, .gitmodules — these must stay at the repo root.
#
# Everything below is GENERATED or LOCAL. It is rebuilt on demand and must
# NEVER be committed. Grouped by what produces it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Python environment — rebuilt by `uv sync` / `uv venv` ──
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# ── Build & packaging output — rebuilt by `uv build` (→ PyPI via twine) ──
/build/
/dist/
*.egg-info/
/zos_plugin/          # generated plugin shim package

# ── Caches — recreated by the tools themselves ──
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ── Generated assets ──
zTheme/               # generated theme assets

# ── Editor / OS cruft ──
.DS_Store

# ── Local Obsidian audit vault — gitignored, regenerated by scripts/audit_gen.py ──
vault/

# ── Cursor IDE state — local workspace config (rules regenerated by `z agents`/`z patch`) ──
.cursor/
.cursorignore
.cursorindexingignore

# ── zDemos — golden reference apps. TRACKED: declarative source (zSpark, zViews,
# models, plugins, zLoom, styles, routes, templates, zRaven test specs, seed Data/
# csv) — this IS what `z demos <name> --clone` clones, so it must be the real,
# versioned checkout, not local-only churn. IGNORED: everything each app
# regenerates on its own (`z raven --run` / `z raven --commit`).
zDemos/*/zRaven/zShots/
zDemos/*/zRaven/output/
zDemos/*/zVersions/
zDemos/*/logs/
zDemos/*/Data/zmigrations/
